  1581	## CLI usage
  1582	Run `bisellium` with no arguments for the exact flag shapes before any CLI call, and before writing one into a subagent brief. The allowlists are strict; a recalled invocation is usually wrong, and a wrong one can write real bookkeeping before it fails.
